cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MCHPRS: A Minecraft server built for redstone"
abstract: "MCHPRS is a Minecraft server featuring Redpiler, an interactive digital circuit compiler and simulator that transforms spatial circuit layouts into optimized directed graphs. Redpiler isolates the logical behavior of circuits from their in-game spatial representation, discarding Minecraft-specific properties that are irrelevant to computation. The compiler follows an LLVM-inspired multi-pass architecture, applying optimizations such as constant folding, dead code elimination, and node coalescing. Its runtime simulator then operates directly on the optimized compiled graph."
